DELETE  /api/v1/admin/agents/{swimlane}  [owner unassigned] The admin operations on agents and their join tokens are in the specification and nobody owns them (D112 A7): the platform's `JoinService` and the agents table exist and no route reaches them.
DELETE  /api/v1/admin/folder-mappings/{id}  [owner unassigned] The admin operation for a registry table is in the specification and nobody owns it (D112 A7): the registry reads the table and its tests seed the rows with SQL, and `hub seed` covers projects, swimlanes, tenants and sentinels.
